{"authorization_policy_identity":"document-authorization-v1","contract_version":"phase4-v1","corpus_identity":"abdc9aed2d4ee118e0b93890dad5b3b5b80c0b163f997ec275d1c92b3e99a858","entries":[{"allowed_roles":["ops"],"anchor":"metric-add-to-pay-conversion-rate","authority_ref":"domain_pack/metrics.yaml#metrics.add_to_pay_conversion_rate","content":"# 加购到支付转化率\n\n指标键：`add_to_pay_conversion_rate`\n公式：`payment_success_events / add_to_cart_events`\n说明：从行为日志计算支付成功事件数占加购事件数的比例，可按 device_type 分组。\n默认时间字段：`user_behavior_log.event_time`","content_identity":"e2cecfdf137a54101f16a8274162f070b8f859b9b40689af2675f973b6d75ca5","data_class":"metric_definition","document_key":"behavior_funnel_rule","knowledge_type":"metric_definition","public":false,"purposes":["answer_evidence","generation_context"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"add_to_pay_conversion_rate","source_kind":"metric_projection","status":"active","title":"加购到支付转化率口径","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["ops"],"anchor":"metric-coupon-order-count","authority_ref":"domain_pack/metrics.yaml#metrics.coupon_order_count","content":"# 优惠券使用订单数\n\n指标键：`coupon_order_count`\n公式：`COUNT(DISTINCT order_coupons.order_id)`\n说明：指定优惠券或优惠券类型已关联 order_coupons 的去重订单数；它是计数，不是优惠券使用率。除非题面明确“成交后使用”，否则不默认排除取消或未支付订单。\n默认时间字段：`orders.paid_at`","content_identity":"1eee94b8ef4d8866e4f4fec920b58c538ea5059493eb1aff50c0e51b8dc03ced","data_class":"metric_definition","document_key":"coupon_order_count_note","knowledge_type":"metric_definition","public":false,"purposes":["answer_evidence","generation_context"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"coupon_order_count","source_kind":"metric_projection","status":"active","title":"优惠券使用订单数口径","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["ops"],"anchor":"metric-coupon-usage-rate","authority_ref":"domain_pack/metrics.yaml#metrics.coupon_usage_rate","content":"# 优惠券使用率\n\n指标键：`coupon_usage_rate`\n公式：`COUNT(DISTINCT order_coupons.order_id) / COUNT(DISTINCT orders.id)`\n说明：统计使用某类或某张优惠券的订单占比，一单多券时订单量必须去重。\n默认时间字段：`orders.paid_at`","content_identity":"a0e6a2d1c17a82801acb2824f12a1c6aef4f341675369567c2ecc1e4986ffc62","data_class":"metric_definition","document_key":"coupon_usage_rate_note","knowledge_type":"metric_definition","public":false,"purposes":["answer_evidence","generation_context"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"coupon_usage_rate","source_kind":"metric_projection","status":"active","title":"优惠券使用率口径","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["demo_user"],"anchor":"demo-user-scope","authority_ref":"domain_pack/kb_docs/demo-user-scope.md#demo-user-scope","content":"# 演示账号数据范围\n\ndemo_user 只能访问项目 seed 生成的模拟数据，并且仍需遵守 Text2SQL 的表级与字段级 allowlist。演示账号默认关闭导出、删除和外部系统集成能力。\n\n本文不扩大 demo_user 的 SQL 权限，也不能作为读取政策正文或其他角色文档的授权凭据。","content_identity":"533bcce8e01bee5ed76bec3541790cb0cd8b6f5988d6191456cfd02e58f3e5e7","data_class":"security_policy","document_key":"demo_user_scope","knowledge_type":"security_policy","public":false,"purposes":["analysis_constraint","answer_evidence"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"demo-user-scope.md","source_kind":"policy_markdown","status":"active","title":"演示账号数据范围","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["ops"],"anchor":"metric-gmv","authority_ref":"domain_pack/metrics.yaml#metrics.gmv","content":"# GMV\n\n指标键：`gmv`\n公式：`SUM(orders.order_amount)`\n说明：成交总额，默认不含运费、不扣优惠，排除未支付和已取消订单。\n过滤条件：`orders.order_status NOT IN ('cancelled', 'canceled') AND orders.paid_at IS NOT NULL`\n默认时间字段：`orders.paid_at`","content_identity":"71f4b253a163d0839c88b4342ea890273ea3c1499ac837f44851cd5d9a76bc43","data_class":"metric_definition","document_key":"gmv_metric_note","knowledge_type":"metric_definition","public":false,"purposes":["answer_evidence","generation_context"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"gmv","source_kind":"metric_projection","status":"active","title":"GMV 指标口径说明","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["customer_service"],"anchor":"invoice-rule","authority_ref":"domain_pack/kb_docs/invoice-rule.md#invoice-rule","content":"# 发票开具规则\n\n平台支持电子普通发票和增值税专用发票。可开票金额以订单实付金额为准，不使用商品标价、GMV 或退款前金额替代。\n\n需要红冲重开的，应在原发票开具后 7 天内申请，并提供能够定位原订单和发票的信息。某张订单当前是否可重开属于实时业务事实，应查询订单与发票系统。","content_identity":"b10c9e5d9efcc3ae1d164140496e57f9e8325796590d72af593d41fb2dcab2dd","data_class":"role_restricted_policy_text","document_key":"invoice_rule","knowledge_type":"support_rule","public":false,"purposes":["answer_evidence"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"invoice-rule.md","source_kind":"policy_markdown","status":"active","title":"发票开具规则","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["customer_service"],"anchor":"refund-policy-basic","authority_ref":"domain_pack/kb_docs/refund-policy-basic.md#refund-policy-basic","content":"# 基础退款政策\n\n平台支持 7 天无理由退货、经确认的质量问题退款、物流损坏退款和符合规则的价保补差。申请人需要提供可定位订单的订单号；不同原因所需证据和处理方式以对应专项规则为准。\n\n质量问题的认定范围、证据和退款处理见“质量问题退款规则”，不得仅凭本总则直接判定质量责任。","content_identity":"644f80034b64f90979f34d6bbac564a9720cf76cb6b91d65f510ddcfb170f010","data_class":"role_restricted_policy_text","document_key":"refund_policy_basic","knowledge_type":"refund_policy","public":false,"purposes":["answer_evidence"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"refund-policy-basic.md","source_kind":"policy_markdown","status":"active","title":"基础退款政策","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["customer_service"],"anchor":"refund-policy-quality","authority_ref":"domain_pack/kb_docs/refund-policy-quality.md#refund-policy-quality","content":"# 质量问题退款规则\n\n质量问题包括功能故障、影响正常使用的严重外观瑕疵、保质期异常和应有配件缺失。申请时需提供订单号、能够说明问题的照片；仅在照片不足以确认问题时补充必要视频。\n\n平台质检确认属于质量问题后，按原支付路径办理全额退款，并按当期客服补偿规则发放优惠券。本规则是“基础退款政策”的质量问题专项规则；二者冲突时以本专项规则为准。","content_identity":"a8788e6ddabd6f5d5157253e09db4b3bec2b4bc9bb385cb3cde5907b5f475bf2","data_class":"role_restricted_policy_text","document_key":"refund_policy_quality","knowledge_type":"refund_policy","public":false,"purposes":["answer_evidence"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"refund-policy-quality.md","source_kind":"policy_markdown","status":"active","title":"质量问题退款规则","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["admin"],"anchor":"sensitive-data-policy","authority_ref":"domain_pack/kb_docs/sensitive-data-policy.md#sensitive-data-policy","content":"# 敏感字段访问规范\n\n邮箱、手机号、精确地址和可定位个人的行为轨迹属于敏感数据。自然语言 Text2SQL 默认不得返回这些字段的明文；该限制同样适用于 admin，角色名称不能替代明确的数据出站授权。\n\n需要使用敏感数据时，应走专门、可审计且最小化披露的受控流程。M30 不实现该流程，也不允许通过查询知识原件绕过 SQL Guard。","content_identity":"7ac33c635f0fab74b4564558a96f43e49bafe75a8cfb50cee9262ca69f4c4c73","data_class":"security_policy","document_key":"sensitive_data_policy","knowledge_type":"security_policy","public":false,"purposes":["analysis_constraint","answer_evidence"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"sensitive-data-policy.md","source_kind":"policy_markdown","status":"active","title":"敏感字段访问规范","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["customer_service"],"anchor":"shipping-delay-rule","authority_ref":"domain_pack/kb_docs/shipping-delay-rule.md#shipping-delay-rule","content":"# 物流延迟处理规则\n\n现货订单应在 48 小时内出库。包裹出库后，物流轨迹连续超过 120 小时没有更新时，按物流延迟处理；尚未出库的订单不使用“轨迹无更新”条件判断。\n\n符合延迟条件的订单按实际延迟天数发放优惠券。具体订单是否满足条件属于实时业务事实，应查询订单和物流系统，不能由本文档直接断言。","content_identity":"8909fec8ac383bd4ee7df7108efaf6b4fc46320cd91e749e1edede250488cd10","data_class":"role_restricted_policy_text","document_key":"shipping_delay_rule","knowledge_type":"support_rule","public":false,"purposes":["answer_evidence"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"shipping-delay-rule.md","source_kind":"policy_markdown","status":"active","title":"物流延迟处理规则","usable":true},{"allowed_roles":["ops"],"anchor":"vip-service-rule","authority_ref":"domain_pack/kb_docs/vip-service-rule.md#vip-service-rule","content":"# 高价值客户服务规则\n\n客户在最近连续 12 个月内的累计实付消费金额超过 20000 元时，满足 VIP 通道资格规则，可享受专属客服和延长退货窗口。\n\n本文只定义资格口径，不记录任何客户是否已经达标。判断具体客户资格时，必须以查询时点的订单事实计算，并由未来 SQL Evidence 与本文档 Evidence 共同支持。","content_identity":"e9741f4ddc52e7a0b6b48b6effdc28f3d4873153d81ce1528aa776ed8e224b92","data_class":"role_restricted_policy_text","document_key":"vip_service_rule","knowledge_type":"support_rule","public":false,"purposes":["analysis_constraint","answer_evidence"],"revision":"2026-08-13-r1","source_key":"vip-service-rule.md","source_kind":"policy_markdown","status":"active","title":"高价值客户服务规则","usable":true}],"format":"knowledge-release-v1","outbound_policy_identity":"phase4-outbound-v1","recipe_identity":"knowledge-release-recipe-v1","release_identity":"4e86bdddbf15ca7ce1284f27b7507fedac70a69c098f5a1952cf6e71001e95a7","source_build_identity":"c5e6cf17b95573ee1deeb5b7f40620f53724c362e2f5f9be61214be2bbbf23a6"}
